        "title": "Ntampui tingmik pat puthe",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ntampui tingmik pat puthe,",
            "Dupkan the muangding khou neimik tei;",
            "Thauruai munbang nchung ngam the,",
            "Bam dutho kam thao kanni the.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Asei bam cham nthuan ntam,",
            "Lung nimak khe hei kandih khou;",
            "Raguang jan khou jasngsu cham kho.",
            "",
            "2. Ntampui ban ham guangmei hei,",
            "Amu maknga tingmik thui ninge;",
            "Tat kan nithe jianmei nun le,",
            "Jao suaklou naro aphai kam.",
            "",
            "3. Tingjin kei kan nimei neimik,",
            "Ai #-5 jangrih jangrihna;",
            "Kei kan the alung le nei hei,",
            "Jianmei bammei luangbut rukhou.",
            "",
            "4. Thingnuang panu munpuang gaimei,",
            "Nthu luan njian lungsimei khuan;",
            "Kandih khou gaimei hou ngam the,",
            "Neilamei njianmei ram mak."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
